# @hub-lanes

# ── CI MINUTES WATCH (K1, 2026-09-24) ───────────────────────────────────────
# bin/ci-minutes-watch.sh — estimated billed CI job-minutes over the last 24h
# (MonkCI bills per job-minute and was running ~120K/day with nothing in the
# harness measuring it). Four ticks a day, each at most repos x (pages +
# sample) GitHub reads, skipped outright while the bucket is low. One critical
# page a day over CI_MINUTES_DAY_MAX. Kill: bin/harness-ctl.sh off ci-minutes-watch.
23 */6 * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/ci-minutes-watch.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
